{"unit_id":"linshufan21__dsh-boot-compass#card-zh","repo":"linshufan21/dsh-boot-compass","commit":"9b1a8f55d6d48a63a209a056e4879913715cc35e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-boot-compass 是面向 DSH 桌面端的全屏罗盘启动动画插件。它通过 webserver/index-inject 在页面头部加入 CSS 覆盖层和启动脚本，并将动画挂载到独立的 shadow root。动画分阶段播放，在主界面就绪时交接，也可点击或按键跳过；Windows 上重新打开窗口时还能重播。可调整主题、时长和重播方式，无需 API 密钥或运行时依赖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-140","lib/boot.js:158-195","lib/boot.js:382-431"]}
{"unit_id":"linshufan21__dsh-boot-compass#card-en","repo":"linshufan21/dsh-boot-compass","commit":"9b1a8f55d6d48a63a209a056e4879913715cc35e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-boot-compass adds a compass splash to the DSH desktop. It injects a cover before the app loads and mounts the animation in an isolated shadow root. The sequence hands off when the app is ready and can be skipped by click or key. Windows can replay it on reopen.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:117-140","lib/boot.js:158-195","lib/boot.js:382-431"]}
